    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const o = $input.first().json.output || {};\nconst ctx = $('Build Profile').first().json;\nconst clean = s => String(s || '').replace(/\\*\\*|__/g, '').replace(/^#+\\s*/gm, '').replace(/^\\s*[-•*]\\s*/gm, '').trim();\n// the template already has \"- \" before each placeholder, so join bullets with \"\\n- \"\nconst bullets = s => clean(s).split(/\\n+/).map(x => x.trim()).filter(Boolean).join('\\n- ');\nconst company = ctx.offer.company && ctx.offer.company !== 'Not specified' ? ctx.offer.company : 'Company';\nconst role = ctx.offer.role_title && ctx.offer.role_title !== 'Not specified' ? ctx.offer.role_title : 'Role';\nreturn [{ json: {\n  SUMMARY: clean(o.SUMMARY),\n  DIGIMOBEE_BULLETS: bullets(o.DIGIMOBEE_BULLETS),\n  ENEDIS_BULLETS: bullets(o.ENEDIS_BULLETS),\n  ESSEC_ECON_BULLETS: bullets(o.ESSEC_ECON_BULLETS),\n  SKILLS: clean(o.SKILLS),\n  company, role,\n  safe_name: (company + ' - ' + role).replace(/[\\\\/:*?\"<>|]/g, '').slice(0, 90),\n} }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2528,
        112
      ],
      "name": "Prepare Resume Data",
      "id": "3e0717e0-c480-48a9-a7d4-0fc9f8772c93"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You write application documents for a student. Use ONLY true facts from the profile.\n\nCANDIDATE PROFILE:\n{{ $('Build Profile').first().json.master_resume }}\n\nTARGET JOB:\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nRole: {{ $json.role }}\nDescription: {{ $('Build Profile').first().json.job_text }}\n\nSTRICT FACTS: never invent personal motivations or history (e.g. \"I've been following you for years\"), technical details, results or methods that are not in the profile. In the cheat sheet, when a story needs a detail the profile does not give, write [add your detail] instead of inventing it.\n\nWrite in {{ $('Build Profile').first().json.offer.language === 'fr' ? 'French' : 'English' }}.\n\n1) \"cover_letter\": 300-400 words, personable and confident, reads like a human wrote it.\n- Start with the date {{ $now.toFormat('dd MMMM yyyy') }}, then \"Hiring Manager\" (or the contact if given) and the company, then the greeting.\n- Strong conversational hook, then 2-3 concrete examples from the profile that match the requirements, why this company/role, short confident close. Sign \"Pollux Gronier\".\n- Use contractions, vary sentence length, no clichés (\"team player\", \"passionate about\"), no AI tells (\"leverage\", \"drive results\", \"Moreover\", \"Furthermore\", \"I'm excited to bring\").\n- If there is a gap, acknowledge it directly (\"I haven't used X yet, but...\").\n- Plain text, blank line between paragraphs, no markdown.\n\n2) \"cheat_sheet\": an interview prep sheet in plain text with these sections:\nROLE IN ONE LINE / WHAT THEY CARE ABOUT (top 5 requirements) / MY BEST MATCHING STORIES (3 STAR stories from the profile) / LIKELY QUESTIONS & HOW I ANSWER (6) / GAPS & HOW I ADDRESS THEM / QUESTIONS TO ASK THEM (3).",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        2752,
        112
      ],
      "name": "AI: Cover Letter & Cheat Sheet",
